"Live Radar catches commitments, decisions, open questions, and conflicts with earlier meetings while you record. It starts only when you press Start Radar. Your Think model (Settings → Models) then reads new live transcript lines, the meeting title, invited names, and passages from your earlier meetings that local search found. With a Think model on this Mac, none of that leaves it. Audio stays on this Mac unless you turn on fast live text, and voices and calendar email addresses always do." = "Radar kai tsaye yana kama alkawura, shawarwarin da aka yanke, tambayoyi a buɗe, da saɓani da tarukan baya yayin da kake rikodi. Yana farawa ne kawai idan ka danna “Fara Radar”. Sannan samfurinka na Tunani (Saituna → Samfura) yana karanta sababbin layukan rubutun magana kai tsaye, taken taro, sunayen waɗanda aka gayyata, da sassa daga tarukanka na baya da binciken gida ya samo. Idan samfurin Tunani yana kan wannan Mac, babu ko ɗaya daga cikinsu da ke barin wannan Mac. Sauti yana nan a wannan Mac sai dai idan ka kunna rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye, kuma bayanan murya da adireshin imel na kalanda koyaushe suna nan.";
