"Fast live text sends meeting audio while the live preview runs, with your name from Settings → Autocomplete as a spelling hint. Voices and calendar email addresses stay on this Mac. The same approval covers Think if you point it at this server." = "Rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye yana aika sautin taro yayin da samfoti kai tsaye ke aiki, tare da sunanka daga Saituna → Kammalawa kai tsaye a matsayin alamar rubutun kalmomi. Bayanan murya da adireshin imel na kalanda suna nan a wannan Mac. Amincewar ɗaya ta shafi Tunani idan ka nuna shi ga wannan sabar.";
"Fast live text: send meeting audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0" = "Rubutu mai sauri kai tsaye: aika sautin taro zuwa Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0";
"While the live transcript preview runs, streams the microphone and call audio to Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0, which returns each turn's text about a second after it ends. Without it, the preview transcribes 12-second chunks on this Mac. Who said what still comes from your microphone and the call track, never from Muse. Costs about $0.36 per meeting hour for the two tracks." = "Yayin da samfotin rubutun magana kai tsaye ke aiki, yana tura sautin makirufo da na kira zuwa Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0, wanda ke mayar da rubutun kowace juyar magana kusan daƙiƙa ɗaya bayan ta ƙare. Idan babu shi, samfoti yana rubuta gutsure na daƙiƙa 12 a wannan Mac. Wanda ya faɗi me har yanzu yana fitowa daga makirufonka da hanyar sautin kira, ba daga Muse ba. Kuɗinsa kusan $0.36 ne a kowace awa ta taro don hanyoyin sauti biyun.";
"Turn-by-turn live text" = "Rubutu kai tsaye bayan kowace juyar magana";
"While the live transcript preview runs, cuts the microphone and call audio at pauses and transcribes each turn with your Transcribe model, so its text appears about a second after the speaker stops. Live Radar then reads after each turn. Without it, the preview transcribes a few seconds at a time." = "Yayin da samfotin rubutun magana kai tsaye ke aiki, yana yanke sautin makirufo da na kira a wuraren dakatawa, kuma yana rubuta kowace juyar magana da samfurin rubuta magana naka, don haka rubutunta yana bayyana kusan daƙiƙa ɗaya bayan mai magana ya tsaya. Sannan Radar kai tsaye yana karantawa bayan kowace juyar magana. Idan babu shi, samfoti yana rubuta daƙiƙoƙi kaɗan a lokaci guda.";
"Answer meeting questions from your screen" = "Amsa tambayoyin taro daga allonka";
"When Live Radar catches a question, LokalBot searches your screen memory on this Mac for captures that mention it, crops each to the rows that do, and gives your Think model the text of up to three crops with their app, window title, and time. An answer is shown only when its quote is in the crop's own text. Screenshots and the search stay on this Mac." = "Idan Radar kai tsaye ya kama tambaya, LokalBot yana bincika ƙwaƙwalwar allonka a wannan Mac don hotunan da suka ambace ta, yana yanke kowanne zuwa layukan da suka ambace ta, kuma yana ba samfurinka na Tunani rubutun har guntu uku tare da manhajarsu, taken taga, da lokaci. Ana nuna amsa ne kawai idan abin da ta ambato yana cikin rubutun guntun da kansa. Hotunan allo da binciken suna nan a wannan Mac.";
"Fast. About 3 s per radar pass." = "Mai sauri. Kusan daƙiƙa 3 a kowane zagayen radar.";
"Strongest reasoning and tool use. About 6 s per radar pass." = "Mafi ƙarfin tunani da amfani da kayan aiki. Kusan daƙiƙa 6 a kowane zagayen radar.";
"Meta's terms for your Model API account apply. Content sent while you use free credits may be used to improve Meta's products, so record only people who agreed." = "Sharuɗɗan Meta na asusun Model API ɗinka suna aiki. Abubuwan da aka aika yayin da kake amfani da kiredit na kyauta za a iya amfani da su don inganta kayayyakin Meta, don haka ka yi rikodin mutanen da suka amince kawai.";
