"When Live Radar catches a question or a problem, your Think model looks for the answer in your work: first what LokalBot remembers (your projects and where they stand, your open actions, what you told it about yourself), then your meetings, what you saw on screen, and the folders below. It is given the question, the last few lines, what LokalBot remembers that bears on it, and the parts of meetings, screen text, documents, and code it reads. An answer is shown only when its sources contain the words it quotes." = "Idan Radar kai tsaye (Live Radar) ya kama tambaya ko matsala, samfurinka na Tunani yana neman amsar a cikin aikinka: da farko abin da LokalBot ya tuna (ayyukanka da inda suka kai, matakanka da ke buɗe, da abin da ka gaya masa game da kanka), sannan tarukanka, abin da ka gani a allo, da manyan fayilolin da ke ƙasa. Ana ba shi tambayar, layukan ƙarshe, abin da LokalBot ya tuna wanda ya shafe ta, da sassan taruka, rubutun allo, takardu, da lambar da ya karanta. Ana nuna amsa ne kawai idan tushenta yana ɗauke da kalmomin da take ambato.";
"Documents, sheets, and PDFs in these folders can be read. In a git repository it also reads tracked code, recent commits, and pull requests and issues through the GitHub CLI. Hidden files, untracked files, and secrets such as .env files and keys are never read." = "Ana iya karanta takardu, falle-falle, da PDF a cikin waɗannan manyan fayilolin. A cikin ma'ajiyar git, yana kuma karanta lambar da ake bibiya, kwanan nan commits, da pull requests da matsaloli ta GitHub CLI. Ba a taɓa karanta fayiloli ɓoyayyu, fayilolin da ba a bibiya ba, da sirrika kamar fayilolin .env da makullai.";
