"Until LokalBot has a verified Google app, Gmail uses your own OAuth client. In Google Cloud, enable the Gmail API, create an OAuth client of type Desktop app, set the app's publishing status to In production so the sign-in doesn't expire after a week, download the client's JSON file, and choose it here." = "Kafin LokalBot ya sami manhajar Google da aka tabbatar, Gmail yana amfani da OAuth client naka. A Google Cloud, kunna Gmail API, ƙirƙiri OAuth client mai nau'in “Desktop app”, saita matsayin wallafa manhajar zuwa “In production” don kada shiga ta ƙare bayan mako guda, sauke fayil ɗin JSON na client ɗin, sannan ka zaɓe shi a nan.";
"Disconnected here, but Google didn't confirm it. You can also remove LokalBot's access in your Google Account settings." = "An cire haɗi a nan, amma Google bai tabbatar ba. Kana iya kuma cire damar LokalBot a saitunan Asusun Google naka.";
"What LokalBot reads" = "Abin da LokalBot ke karantawa";
"LokalBot reads headers first and downloads a conversation only if you wrote in it, or if someone on your calendar takes part and it isn't bulk mail. It never reads Spam, Trash, or Drafts, and it keeps attachment names but never their contents. It checks for new mail at launch, every few hours, each morning, and before meetings. Google's read-only permission means LokalBot can't send, delete, or change mail." = "LokalBot yana fara karanta kanun saƙonni, kuma yana sauke tattaunawa ne kawai idan ka rubuta a ciki, ko idan wani da ke cikin kalandarka yana ciki kuma ba imel da aka aika wa jama'a da yawa ba ne. Ba ya taɓa karanta Spam, Shara ko Daftari, kuma yana adana sunayen haɗe-haɗe amma ba ya taɓa adana abin da ke cikinsu. Yana duba sabbin imel lokacin buɗewa, bayan wasu sa'o'i, kowace safiya, da kafin taruka. Izinin karantawa kawai na Google yana nufin LokalBot ba zai iya aikawa, gogewa ko canza imel ba.";
"Disconnect %@?" = "A cire haɗin %@?";
"Disconnect" = "Cire haɗi";
