"LokalBot asks Google for read-only access to Gmail. It downloads conversations you wrote in and mail with people on your calendar from the last 90 days, and uses them to brief you before meetings with those people. Mail stays encrypted on this Mac and is never sent to LokalBot or anyone else. Disconnecting deletes it." = "LokalBot yana roƙon Google damar karanta Gmail kawai. Yana sauke tattaunawar kwanaki 90 da suka gabata waɗanda ka rubuta a ciki, da imel tare da mutanen da ke cikin kalandarka, kuma yana amfani da su don ba ka taƙaitaccen bayani kafin tarukanka da waɗannan mutane. Imel suna zama a ɓoye cikin wannan Mac kuma ba a taɓa aika su ga LokalBot ko wani daban ba. Cire haɗi yana goge su.";
"For your own Google Cloud project: enable the Gmail API, create an OAuth client of type Desktop app, publish it, download its JSON file, and choose it here. New sign-ins then use your client instead of LokalBot's." = "Don aikin Google Cloud naka: kunna Gmail API, ƙirƙiri OAuth client mai nau'in “Desktop app”, wallafa shi, sauke fayil ɗinsa na JSON, sannan ka zaɓe shi a nan. Daga nan sabbin shiga za su yi amfani da client naka maimakon na LokalBot.";
