"LokalBot reads the folders you choose and keeps an index of their text, pictures and sound in its library. Nothing leaves this Mac. The first time, it downloads EmbeddingGemma 2's image model (555 MB). Turning Files off deletes the index." = "LokalBot yana karanta manyan fayilolin da ka zaɓa kuma yana adana fihirisar rubutunsu, hotunansu da sautinsu a ɗakin ajiyarsa. Babu abin da ke barin wannan Mac. A karon farko, yana sauke samfurin hotuna na EmbeddingGemma 2 (555 MB). Kashe Fayiloli yana goge fihirisar.";
"LokalBot stops reading the chosen folders and deletes the file index. Your files are not touched." = "LokalBot yana daina karanta manyan fayilolin da aka zaɓa kuma yana goge fihirisar fayiloli. Ba a taɓa fayilolinka ba.";
