"Last pass read %lld files in %@." = "Zagaye na ƙarshe ya karanta fayiloli %lld cikin %@.";
"File search" = "Binciken fayiloli";
"Search the folders you choose by what is in them: documents and PDFs by their words and meaning, pictures and screenshots by what they show. Files are read on this Mac and never changed." = "Bincika manyan fayilolin da ka zaɓa ta abin da ke cikinsu: takardu da PDF ta kalmominsu da ma'anarsu, hotuna da hotunan allo ta abin da suke nunawa. Ana karanta fayiloli a wannan Mac kuma ba a taɓa canja su ba.";
"LokalBot reads only the folders listed here: pictures and screenshots, PDFs page by page, and documents such as txt, md, rtf, docx, odt and html. It skips hidden folders, app bundles, caches, code projects (except their screenshots), folders that look like datasets, and iCloud files that are not downloaded. With recordings and video included, sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot, so a search can open the moment in LokalBot's player. The index keeps each file's path, its text, and a vector of what it says, shows or sounds like, in the LokalBot library. The image and text model downloads once and runs only while new or changed files are read. Reading pauses while a meeting records, in Low Power Mode, and while the Mac is warm. While you use the Mac, a folder's first read goes at about a third of full speed, and at full speed once you step away. On battery it waits for a charger unless Read big folders on battery is on." = "LokalBot yana karanta manyan fayilolin da aka jera a nan kawai: hotuna da hotunan allo, PDF shafi bayan shafi, da takardu kamar txt, md, rtf, docx, odt da html. Yana tsallake manyan fayiloli da aka ɓoye, fakitin manhajoji, ma'ajiyar wucin gadi, ayyukan lamba (sai dai hotunan allonsu), manyan fayilolin da suke kama da tarin bayanai, da fayilolin iCloud da ba a sauke ba. Idan an haɗa rikodi da bidiyo, ana karanta sauti daƙiƙa 30 a lokaci ɗaya, bidiyo kuma hoto ɗaya ga kowane fage, don bincike ya iya buɗe wannan lokacin a na'urar kunnawa ta LokalBot. Fihirisar tana adana hanyar kowane fayil, rubutunsa, da vekto na abin da yake faɗa, nunawa, ko yadda sautinsa yake, a ɗakin ajiyar LokalBot. Ana sauke samfurin hotuna da rubutu sau ɗaya kuma yana aiki ne kawai yayin da ake karanta sababbin fayiloli ko waɗanda aka canja. Karatu yana tsayawa yayin da ake rikodin taro, a Yanayin ƙarancin wuta, da kuma yayin da Mac ke da zafi. Yayin da kake amfani da Mac, karatun farko na babban fayil yana tafiya a kusan kashi ɗaya cikin uku na cikakken gudu, kuma a cikakken gudu da zarar ka tashi. A kan batiri yana jiran caja, sai dai idan “Karanta manyan fayiloli masu girma a kan batiri” yana kunne.";
"Search by meaning also matches what captured screens show. The first such search downloads EmbeddingGemma 2's image model (555 MB); picture vectors are deleted with the pixels." = "Bincike ta ma'ana yana kuma dacewa da abin da allunan da aka ɗauka ke nunawa. Bincike na farko irin wannan yana sauke samfurin hotuna na EmbeddingGemma 2 (555 MB); ana goge vekto na hotuna tare da pixels.";
