"How it works" = "Yadda yake aiki";
"This Mac accepts connections only from private network addresses and Tailscale, and only from devices you paired by scanning a code and allowing them here. Every connection is end-to-end encrypted with the Noise protocol. Phones sync whenever they can reach this Mac and keep their copy for offline reading. LokalBot runs no server and receives nothing." = "Wannan Mac yana karɓar haɗi ne kawai daga adiresoshin cibiyar sadarwa masu zaman kansu da Tailscale, kuma daga na'urorin da ka haɗa ta hanyar duba lamba ka kuma ba su izini a nan kawai. Kowace haɗi an ɓoye ta daga ƙarshe zuwa ƙarshe da ka'idar Noise. Wayoyi suna daidaitawa duk lokacin da suka iya isa wannan Mac, kuma suna riƙe kwafinsu don karantawa ba tare da intanet ba. LokalBot ba ya gudanar da wata sabar kuma ba ya karɓar komai.";
